## Runtime flags for mcl_distributor.

## NO ERLANG DISTRIBUTION LISTENER. The distributor serves members over the
## mesh (sealed calls) and uses no distributed Erlang. relx's start script
## demands a node name, so the node has a short one, but it starts no epmd
## and never listens for a node connection, and it has no cookie: no remote
## shell or dist-eval can reach the process that holds the epoch keys.
-sname mcl_distributor
-start_epmd false
-dist_listen false

+K true

## Async thread pool: pulls arrive over the pool's sockets.
+A 16

## A distributor under a pull storm must queue, not crash the VM on
## process limits.
+P 1048576
+Q 1048576
